Description: Multi-backend deep learning API (Keras 3)
 Keras is a deep learning API written in Python, capable of running on
 top of JAX, TensorFlow, or PyTorch. It provides a consistent, high-level
 interface for building and training neural networks.
 .
 Packaged as a TensorFlow dependency for the invokeai-mastodon
